{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1218\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>現年 72 歲的八両金（葉競生）是 90 年代著名諧星，曾拍攝多部經典電影包括《食神》、《行運一條龍》、《喜劇之王》等，其標誌性的招牌冬菇頭與幽默形象早已深得民心。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1219\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>近年主力在內地發展的他，不僅自資開拍網絡電影，亦積極加入直播行列，一直默默耕耘。日前，有網民在搭高鐵時意外偶遇八両金，事後更在社交平台大爆對方的真實性格，迅速引爆網民熱烈討論！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1219\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b5125b21-9589-4a53-9976-9463a644ede0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MlloC5vdav1790133836.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b5125b21-9589-4a53-9976-9463a644ede0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1219\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1220\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>該網民分享，指自己機緣巧合下剛好坐在八両金隔離，在上網搜索近照確認後才敢向前相認。令她喜出望外的是，八両金毫無明星架子之餘，更與她非常熱情地暢聊：「成程車 48 分鐘就傾足 48 分鐘，交換埋 WeChat 真人好 nice！」她更透露八両金面對任何提問都非常有耐性且有問必答，並分享了不少充滿人生智慧的金句，對其他乘客的合照要求亦是來者不拒，盡顯極高親和力。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1220\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1f529516-86cb-46db-825a-ded4ce4ae4bb.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Y8z8PG8rFw1790133837.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1f529516-86cb-46db-825a-ded4ce4ae4bb.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1221\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從網民分享的照片可見，八両金身穿白色短 T 恤配搭黑色馬甲，面色紅潤，笑容十分燦爛，更對著鏡頭大方比起 V 字勝利手勢，顯得非常精神且精靈！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1221\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_9b37b29d19d8eb69-1222\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>帖文曝光後，大批網民紛紛留言附和讚賞：「係啊！佢真係無咩架子」，更有人驚嘆他保養得宜，完全看不出已經年過七旬：「原來八両金已經 70 幾歲啦睇唔出」、「Keep 得好」！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:20:20.047654+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":509,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}